lices, cinnamon churro, bell pepper crisps, carrot sticks under the BranchOut brand. The company also provides dehydrated prunes, carrots, brussels sprouts, and raisins, as well as other fruit and vegetable products; and dehydrated fruit and vegetable ingredients, including pieces, fragments, and powders. It offers its products through retail grocery stores, club stores, online retailers, and direct-to-consumer e-commerce platforms. The company was formerly known as AvoLov, LLC and changed its name to BranchOut Food Inc. in November 2021. BranchOut Food Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Bend, Oregon."}}